SUMMARY:The Humanist Review of AI: Abundance & Scarcity
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California\, Taube Family Audit
 orium\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94105
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-11-18/humanist-review-ai-a
 bundance-scarcity
DESCRIPTION:What becomes scarce when intelligence is abundant? Artificial i
 ntelligence promises a new era of abundance—but how will it deliver on t
 hat promise? And what impact will abundance have on how our society works?
  This event marks the publication of the second issue of The Humanist Revi
 ew of AI\, a new journal of ideas funded by Microsoft AI that explores the
 se questions. For more\, visit the Humanist Review of AI's website. About 
 the Speakers\n\nInfo & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/20
 26-11-18/humanist-review-ai-abundance-scarcity
END:VEVENT
