SUMMARY:The Machine-Mediated Economy: When AI Becomes the Interface to Ever
 ything
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California\, Toni Rembe Rock Au
 ditorium\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94105
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-11-19/machine-mediated-eco
 nomy-when-ai-becomes-interface-everything
DESCRIPTION:We’re entering an economy where AI increasingly sits between 
 people and the companies\, products and services they choose. Discovery\, 
 evaluation\, comparison and eventually transactions are moving inside AI. 
 What happens when your customer’s AI talks to your company’s AI before
  the customer ever talks to you? We’ll explore what this shift means for
  business and markets\, along with what Toby Corey's team is learning firs
 thand building BrandCapsule\, an AI discovery intelligence company. About 
 the Speakers\n\nInfo & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/20
 26-11-19/machine-mediated-economy-when-ai-becomes-interface-everything
END:VEVENT
