SUMMARY:Sam Wasson: Frank Capra’s Own Wondrous Life
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-11-30/sam-wasson-frank-cap
 ras-own-wondrous-life
DESCRIPTION:Frank Capra\, the director of Mr. Smith Goes to Washington\, It
  Happened One Night\, and It’s a Wonderful Life\, is renowned as one of 
 the great chroniclers of the American heart—how we love\, dream\, hope a
 nd fight for our individuality. But Frank Capra was a far more complex art
 ist than is usually reckoned and a far more complicated man than anyone kn
 ows. As Jimmy Stewart\, his most famous collaborator\, put it\, “the bes
 t Frank Capra story is the story of his own life. It’s got more highs an
 d lows than a roller coaster. It’s heartwarming.\n\nInfo & tickets: http
 s://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-11-30/sam-wasson-frank-capras-own
 -wondrous-life
END:VEVENT
