 ck Dong\, a visionary craftsman\, sculptor and engineer\, brings to Common
 wealth Club World Affairs a unique audiovisual experience that’s totally
  different from anything Club members have ever seen or heard before.\n\nI
 nfo & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-12-02/intersec
 tion-art-therapy-and-spiritual-enlightenment-engineers-perspective
