SUMMARY:The Novelist & the Economist: Kim Stanley Robinson and John Fullert
 on on the Story We Need Next
LOCATION:The Commonwealth Club of California\, Toni Rembe Rock Auditorium\,
  San Francisco\, CA\, 94105
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-12-08/novelist-economist-k
 im-stanley-robinson-and-john-fullerton-story-we-need-next
DESCRIPTION:A novelist and an economist walk into a bar. Outside\, the worl
 d is in polycrisis. One of them spent 20 years in the belly of the beast\,
  becoming the second youngest managing director in JPMorgan’s history\, 
 followed by a two-decade search after a close encounter with 9/11. The oth
 er has spent four decades writing novels set on Mars\, in a flooded New Yo
 rk\, and inside a ministry created to speak for generations not yet born. 
 You might expect the banker to bring the hard facts and the novelist the i
 magination. On this evening\, it may run the other way.\n\nInfo & tickets:
  https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-12-08/novelist-economist-kim
 -stanley-robinson-and-john-fullerton-story-we-need-next
