 n Francisco\, CA\, 94105
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-12-08/daniel-swain-2026-st
 ephen-schneider-award-outstanding-climate-science
DESCRIPTION:Have questions about weather and climate? Daniel Swain has answ
 ers. Swain’s research on “hydroclimate whiplash”—the extreme swing
 s between floods and fires—is fundamental. But the general public knows 
 him better as the host of the popular blog and YouTube channel “Weather 
 West\,” which has tens of thousands of subscribers. In his quest to make
  extreme weather\, climate change\, and associated natural hazards underst
 andable and accurate in public discourse\, Swain holds weekly “office ho
 urs” on YouTube and gives over 200 interviews a year across hundreds of 
 media outlets.\n\nInfo & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/
 2026-12-08/daniel-swain-2026-stephen-schneider-award-outstanding-climate-s
 cience
