SUMMARY:Jon Haveman: The Economics of Immigration
LOCATION:Lafayette Public Library\, Don Tatzin Auditorium\, Lafayette\, CA\
 , 94549
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2026-12-17/jon-haveman-economic
 s-immigration
DESCRIPTION:Masked troops of ICE and CBP are scooping up immigrants\, occas
 ionally shooting or beating one or two. Is this good policy? Immigration i
 s a policy issue with both social and economic implications. Economics has
  something to say about both. This presentation will shed light on several
  aspects of immigration that tend to overwhelm the narrative. These are: c
 rime\, government support programs\, and jobs. It will also raise other is
 sues that ought to be contemplated when developing appropriate immigration
  policy. About the Speaker\n\nInfo & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub
 .org/events/2026-12-17/jon-haveman-economics-immigration
END:VEVENT
