SUMMARY:Michael Shellenberger and Alex Gutentag: The Left's War on Reality
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California\, Taube Family Audit
 orium\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94105
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2027-01-07/michael-shellenberge
 r-and-alex-gutentag-lefts-war-reality-0
DESCRIPTION:In The Left's War on Reality\, Michael Shellenberger and Alex G
 utentag\, two former progressives\, delve into the unsettling truth behind
  the left’s policies. What they uncover is far more troubling than mere 
 unintended consequences. Through nine meticulously researched case studies
 \, they reveal a shocking conclusion: the destruction caused by the left i
 sn’t accidental—it’s deliberate.\n\nInfo & tickets: https://www.comm
 onwealthclub.org/events/2027-01-07/michael-shellenberger-and-alex-gutentag
 -lefts-war-reality-0
END:VEVENT
