SUMMARY:From Cyberselfish to the Nerd Reich: The Rise of Radical Silicon Va
 lley
LOCATION:Lafayette Public Library\, Don Tatzin Auditorium\, Lafayette\, CA\
 , 94549
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2027-01-14/cyberselfish-nerd-re
 ich-rise-radical-silicon-valley
DESCRIPTION:Paulina Borsook’s work Cyberselfish—now in a current printi
 ng\, has been rediscovered as "accidental prophecy"—has been called a sh
 arp\, prescient critique of Silicon Valley's emerging elite during the lat
 e-1990s dot-com boom. She identified several toxic cultural undercurrents 
 that she says have now become mainstream realities across global tech infr
 astructure:\n\nInfo & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/202
 7-01-14/cyberselfish-nerd-reich-rise-radical-silicon-valley
END:VEVENT
