SUMMARY:Robert Alter: The Language of Fiction\, the Craft of Writing and th
 e Pleasures of Reading
LOCATION:The Commonwealth Club of California\, Toni Rembe Rock Auditorium\,
  San Francisco\, CA\, 94105
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2027-01-19/robert-alter-languag
 e-fiction-craft-writing-and-pleasures-reading
DESCRIPTION:What distinguishes the prose of great novels? How have celebrat
 ed novelists shaped language into a lasting source of insight and aestheti
 c pleasure? The award-winning literary critic Robert Alter explores the li
 terary devices and techniques novelists have used to write famous fiction.
 \n\nInfo & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2027-01-19/rob
 ert-alter-language-fiction-craft-writing-and-pleasures-reading
END:VEVENT
