SUMMARY:The Economy 2027: Will the “Boomcession” Continue?
LOCATION:The Commonwealth Club of California\, 110 The Embarcadero\, San Fr
 ancisco\, CA\, 94105
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2027-02-11/economy-2027-will-bo
 omcession-continue
DESCRIPTION:The Walter E. Hoadley Annual Economic Forecast\, presented by B
 ank of America. The current state of the U.S. economy has been described a
 s a “boomcession”: Even as a surge in AI investment is boosting the st
 ock market and GDP\, many ordinary Americans are feeling left behind. To b
 e sure\, the economy is still booming\, at least on paper\, and consumers 
 are still spending\, But inflation\, rising gas prices\, and borrowing cos
 ts are all putting the squeeze on households.\n\nInfo & tickets: https://w
 ww.commonwealthclub.org/events/2027-02-11/economy-2027-will-boomcession-co
 ntinue
END:VEVENT
