SUMMARY:Amory Lovins on Disruptive Energy Futures
LOCATION:The Commonwealth Club of California\, Taube Family Auditorium\, Sa
 n Francisco\, CA\, 94105
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2027-02-23/amory-lovins-disrupt
 ive-energy-futures
DESCRIPTION:In a visionary essay in Foreign Affairs\, physicist Amory Lovin
 s opened by asking\, “Where are America's formal or de facto energy poli
 cies leading us? Where might we choose to go instead?” That was 50 years
  ago. And those critical questions remain just as relevant today\, especia
 lly against the backdrop of geopolitical tensions\, energy security concer
 ns\, and accelerating climate disruption.\n\nInfo & tickets: https://www.c
 ommonwealthclub.org/events/2027-02-23/amory-lovins-disruptive-energy-futur
 es
END:VEVENT
