SUMMARY:Lindsey Caplan and Anthony Veneziale: The Art and Science of What M
 oves Us and How to Move Others
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California\, Taube Family Audit
 orium\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94105
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2027-03-11/lindsey-caplan-and-a
 nthony-veneziale-art-and-science-what-moves-us-and-how-move
DESCRIPTION:We know when it happens: A story\, a teacher\, a performance\, 
 an idea\, or a person reaches us and leaves us changed. Many times in life
  people are asked to move a group: to get a team behind a strategy\, a cla
 ssroom invested in learning\, an audience to care\, or a community to act.
  Most of us were never taught how to do that. So we announce\, explain\, a
 nd push. People comply for a while\, then return to what they were doing b
 efore.\n\nInfo & tickets: https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2027-03-
 11/lindsey-caplan-and-anthony-veneziale-art-and-science-what-moves-us-and-
 how-move
END:VEVENT
