SUMMARY:Vladimir Alexandrov: Imperial Russian Support for the Union During 
 the Civil War
LOCATION:The Commonwealth Club of California\, Toni Rembe Rock Auditorium\,
  San Francisco\, CA\, 94105
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2027-03-18/vladimir-alexandrov-
 imperial-russian-support-union-during-civil-war
DESCRIPTION:In 1863\, as the Civil War raged\, Russian warships suddenly ap
 peared in New York and San Francisco\, sparking celebrations across the No
 rth and raising hopes that Russia might support the United States should B
 ritain and France recognize the Confederacy.\n\nInfo & tickets: https://ww
 w.commonwealthclub.org/events/2027-03-18/vladimir-alexandrov-imperial-russ
 ian-support-union-during-civil-war
