 n his new memoir A Very Particular Set of Skills. Come see him at Commonwe
 alth Club World Affairs to hear all about it.\n\nInfo & tickets: https://w
 ww.commonwealthclub.org/events/2027-03-25/robert-mark-kamen-screenwriters-
