SUMMARY:An Evening with Dan Ashley: Side Quests to Significance
LOCATION:Commonwealth Club World Affairs of California\, Taube Family Audit
 orium\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94105
URL:https://www.commonwealthclub.org/events/2027-06-03/evening-dan-ashley-s
 ide-quests-significance
DESCRIPTION:What if the measure of a significant life isn't what you accumu
 lated\, but what you awakened in other people? "An Evening with Dan Ashley
 " is not simply an interview with a celebrated broadcaster and musician. I
 t is a 65-minute journey through the "side quests" that shaped Dan's life
 —and the people who became better\, braver and more purposeful because h
 e chose to pursue them. This evening asks a simple question: Who will you 
 become because of the life you've been given?\n\nInfo & tickets: https://w
 ww.commonwealthclub.org/events/2027-06-03/evening-dan-ashley-side-quests-s
 ignificance
END:VEVENT
